and go, that's a much simpler explanation of something I've been

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.100
thinking about for a long time.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.020
And I had a few of those moments reading this article you wrote.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:40.180
So you talk about these four moves, the pause, ask, listen and reflect.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.380
