00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:40.890
where I didn't notice the subtleties, I didn't take that pause.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:43.330
It's easy to be carried away in the moment

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:46.450
and be really focused on the technical aspect,

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.010
making sure you're going to get through UAT,

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.890
making sure this is going to roll out to production smoothly.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:56.690
