00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:10.450
So it's easy to get carried away and get focused on that.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:15.210
But missing it, and this is one of the things to talk about,

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:19.210
I mean, really, it's not so much about the feelings aspect.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:23.450
It's more you have to think about the cost that downstream

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:26.970
it's going to cost in terms of time,

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:31.290
in terms of having to redo things, rebuild things, scope creep,

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:35.130
having stakeholders downstream push back.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:39.790
So as much as it's hard to do, it's critical.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:42.350
Now to your question, why do so many people miss it?

